        "bookmark_count": 42,
        "impression_count": 165796,
        "like_count": 378,
        "quote_count": 11,
        "reply_count": 12,
        "retweet_count": 18
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2075218938687013137",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "3/ computer use: it can operate desktop, browser, and mobile. muse spark 1.1 is trained to know when to automate and when to use interfaces directly. it scripts when that’s faster, clicks when direct interaction is simpler, and batches actions at each step. https://t.co/oyw1x4q1av",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/2075218942059274641"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2026-07-09T14:02:05.000Z",
