        "text": "Today we are launching Muse Spark 1.1, an upgrade to muse spark 1 that greatly improves agentic, coding, multimodal, and computer use capabilities. We're also launching the Meta Model API in public preview.\n\nhttps://t.co/Th9DzacJaW https://t.co/2dPrm5b0U2"
